{
  "version": 2,
  "formula": "raw = base * (100 - percent) for Lower, base * (100 + percent) for Higher (integer); price = ((raw + 500) div 1000) * 10; clamp to 100..9900000. A rule covers a night d when from <= d <= to and it is not paused and not pausedByPlan. Nights = checkIn .. checkOut - 1 day. perNight = total / nights rounded to the nearest Rs 10 (a .5 tie rounds up) = ((total + 5 * nights) div (10 * nights)) * 10. chip = the biggest Lower percent covering a night, only when the sum over the nights of the signed percents (Lower minus, Higher plus) of the covering rules is below 0; else null. fullOnDates = a block [from, to] (inclusive nights) touches a night checkIn .. checkIn + nights - 1. partyQuote total = sum of units x total(basePrice); perNight of that total. stayCardChip30 = among active Lower rules with to >= today and from <= today + 30, the one with the earliest from (tie: bigger percent); its percent, else null.",
